<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 64px', background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 88, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
            五进程闭环 600 拍：调度说「停机」，区间就收成 [0, 0]
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
            证据分两处取：一处从共享内存段里读真值，一处看 EMS 进程自己的联调检查项
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginTop: 4 }}>
        <Image src="assets/five_proc.png" style={{ width: 1000, height: 314 }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, marginTop: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '12px 15px', background: '#ECFEFF', borderRadius: 10, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#06B6D4', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
                ① 读侧探针（共享内存段内真值）
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Consolas', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                present=1　seq=4<br />
                p_setpoint=120.500　pcs_onoff=0<br />
                narrow([-200, 200]) = [0, 0]
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1.15, padding: '12px 15px', background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 10, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
                ② EMS 进程联调检查项
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Consolas', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                [PASS] 外部设定 · EXT 停机闭锁收成 [0,0]<br />
                ext_active=600 拍 / [0,0] 拍 = 600
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '12px 15px', background: '#F1F5F9', borderRadius: 10, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
                ③ 顺带验到的兜底
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                主站一断开，网关立刻执行清空 —— 快路径失效兜底生效。
                另有 3 个预期内的失败，是反向守卫正确地报告了"这件事没发生"。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 34, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>工商业储能 EMS · 0919-0920 两天交付汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>20 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
